      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN DESTINY (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 22.62 beating Zipping Osaka. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. HARD STYLE GIRL (2) shapes nicely here coming off a blistering 22.37 win at Bulli over 400m. Harder here but expected to measure up. QUICK THINKIN' (6) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from four starts. Scored by 5 lengths last time (22.29) in a Grade 4/5 over 400m at Maitland. Can feature in the finish. LAURIE'S RUPEE (3) profiles nicely over this trip.",
